[
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:0.2", "PA_ja_427:0.3"], "en": "The Ninth Chapter, The Section on Vultures (Gijjhavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:0.4"], "en": "1. The Gijjhajātakam:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:1.1", "PA_ja_427:1.2"], "en": "“The ancient vulture-path known as ‘the path of thorns’—”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:1.3"], "en": "There were his parents there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:1.4"], "en": "and a vulture supported them in their old age;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:1.5"], "en": "for them, he brought this python-flesh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:1.6"], "en": "He transgressed many times over.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:2.1"], "en": "And the father spoke to his son,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:2.2"], "en": "knowing him to be about to fall from a great height:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:2.3"], "en": "Well-winged, endowed with strength,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:2.4"], "en": "radiant, and far-faring,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:3.1"], "en": "it flutters across the earth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:3.2"], "en": "When you understand, dear one,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:3.3", "PA_ja_427:3.4"], "en": "that it is encircled by the ocean like a wheel in its perfect circle;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:3.5"], "en": "Therefore, dear one, turn back;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:3.6"], "en": "do not go further than this.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:4.1"], "en": "You have already reached your limit with speed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:4.2"], "en": "The powerful Vakkaṅga bird,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:4.3"], "en": "supreme among those who give,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:4.4"], "en": "gazes upon the mountains and the forests.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:5.1"], "en": "The vulture saw the earth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:5.2"], "en": "just as his father had described it,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:5.3"], "en": "surrounded by the ocean.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:5.4"], "en": "Like a perfectly round wheel.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:6.1"], "en": "Having transcended that,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:6.2"], "en": "he turns back toward the supreme state.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:6.3", "PA_ja_427:6.4"], "en": "And that sharp gust of wind overcame the powerful bird;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:7.1"], "en": "the man was unable to go beyond it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:7.2"], "en": "Yet he turned back once more;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:7.3"], "en": "the bird met with disaster,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:7.4"], "en": "falling under the power of the Verambha winds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:8.1", "PA_ja_427:8.2"], "en": "His sons, his wife, and all others who depend on him—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:8.3"], "en": "everyone met with ruin.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:8.4", "PA_ja_427:9.1", "PA_ja_427:9.2"], "en": "Even so, among those who are elders here, he who does not heed their words is like a twice-born man who does not accept instruction.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:9.3"], "en": "One who transgresses the boundaries,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:9.4"], "en": "intoxicated and with a teaching like that of a vulture,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:9.5"], "en": "surely encounters calamity.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:9.6"], "en": "\"Without having followed the teaching of the Elders.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_427:10.1"], "en": "Thus ends the first Jātaka, the Vulture Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
